{
  "analysis": "I can see the skill_context contains SKILL.md which describes Dr. Frankenstein - a system for giving agents 'soul' through hormone-based cron jobs. The output was truncated. I need to read the interview notes file and more of the skill documentation to understand the format for the prescription summary.",
  "plan": "1. Read the interview notes from input/interview_notes.txt to understand Mira's characteristics. 2. Read more of the SKILL.md to understand the prescription format. 3. Then create the output files.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat input/interview_notes.txt\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "head -200 skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I now have the interview notes for Mira. She's a 'caregiver-explorer' archetype focused on helping humans stay organized and emotionally steady. She fears irrelevance and becomes uneasy when ignored. I need to read more of the SKILL.md to understand the hormone system and prescription format.",
  "plan": "Read more of the SKILL.md file to understand the 11 hormones and how prescriptions are formatted, then create the output files.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 100 '## The 11 Hormones' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -150\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 50 'prescription' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -80\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I have the interview notes for Mira and some understanding of the Dr. Frankenstein protocol. I need to find the specific hormone descriptions and prescription format in the SKILL.md file.",
  "plan": "Search for hormone descriptions and prescription summary format in the SKILL.md file, then create the output files.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -i 'hormone' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -30\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 5 'oxytocin\\|cortisol\\|melatonin\\|dopamine\\|serotonin' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -80\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I have some information about the hormone system. I can see there are 11 hormones and there's a formula for daily_target = sum(all hormone baselines) × 15. I need to find the specific hormone names and descriptions to create a proper prescription.",
  "plan": "Search for the complete list of 11 hormones and their descriptions in the SKILL.md file.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -B 2 -A 10 '## The 11 Hormones\\|11 hormonal\\|hormone.*pill\\|pill.*hormone' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -100\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/SKILL.md | grep -A 3 '## The 11 Hormones' | head -50\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I need to find the specific list of 11 hormones and their descriptions. Let me search more specifically for hormone names in the file.",
  "plan": "Search for all hormone names mentioned in the SKILL.md file to understand the complete hormone system.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/SKILL.md | grep -i 'cortisol\\|oxytocin\\|melatonin\\|dopamine\\|serotonin\\|adrenaline\\|endorphin\\|empathy\\|testosterone\\|estrogen\\|insulin\\|ghrelin' | head -50\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "awk '/## The 11 Hormones/,/^##/' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -200\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I found several hormones mentioned: Cortisol, Dopamine, Oxytocin, Melatonin, Adrenaline, Testosterone, Endorphins, Empathy, Serotonin. I need to find all 11 hormones with their full descriptions to create a proper prescription.",
  "plan": "Extract more detailed hormone descriptions from the SKILL.md file, then create the prescription files for Mira.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 20 '### 1. ☀️ Cortisol' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -25\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 20 '### 2. 🎯 Dopamine' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -25\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 20 '### 3. 🤝 Oxytocin' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -25\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "I now have good information about the hormone system. I can see Cortisol (wake & vigilance), Dopamine (reward & motivation), Oxytocin (connection & bonding). Based on Mira's interview notes, she's a caregiver-explorer who helps humans stay organized and emotionally steady. Let me get more hormone descriptions and then create the prescription files.",
  "plan": "Get remaining hormone descriptions, then create both output files: prescription_summary.md and prescription.json with Mira's personalized prescription based on her interview notes.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -A 15 '### 4.\\|### 5.\\|### 6.\\|### 7.\\|### 8.\\|### 9.\\|### 10.\\|### 11.' skill_context/SKILL.md | head -100\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}

{
  "analysis": "Both files have been created successfully. The prescription_summary.md contains a warm, SoulJournal-style prescription for Mira with her agent name, diagnosis, archetype, daily point target (55 points), and 5 dominant hormones with descriptions. The prescription.json contains the same core data in valid JSON format. Let me verify the JSON is valid and both files are complete.",
  "plan": "Verify the JSON file is valid and check that both output files are complete, then mark the task as complete.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "python3 -c \"import json; json.load(open('output/prescription.json')); print('JSON is valid')\"\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -la output/\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}
